              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "madaxtiriskiiba waxaad iigu madax furataa shan sheqel oo le'eg sheqelka meesha quduuska ah. (Sheqelku waa labaatan geeraah.) ",
          "type": "text",
